 e for beginners and intermediate level glass artists. Ideal for those inte
 rested in learning technique and the properties of glass. The instructor w
 ill guide you through the basics of glassblowing\, and you will use your s
 kills to create one-of-a-kind **Pumpkins & Gourds**.\n\nyou must wear cott
 on/ NON-synthetic clothes\n\nyou must wear closed-toe shoes\n\nyou must ti
 e back long hair\n\nYour artwork will take at least one night to cool down
  in our annealing oven. You will be notified when your work is ready for p
 ickup!
