 ent\, this is an Intermediate level\n\nRequirement: You must have comple
 ted a Beginner Cuban Salsa course or have a solid grasp of beginner fundam
 entals \\(including basic footwork\, timing\, standard left/right turns\, 
 and fundamental partner connection\\).\n\nWhat We Will Cover\n\n• Advanc
 ed Partnerwork: Intricate Cuban Casino patterns\, seamless transitions\, 
 and directional changes.\n\n• Styling & Body Movement: Incorporating au
 thentic Cuban body isolation and natural expression into your dancing.\n\n
 • Musicality & Connection: Refining lead/follow mechanics to hit musica
 l breaks and accents naturally.\n\n• Intensive Structure: We will kick 
 off with a quick body isolation warm-up and advanced footwork exercises be
 fore diving straight into partnerwork technique and practical\, social-rea
 dy combinations.\n\nCome dance with us\, elevate your technique\, and expe
 rience the energy and flavor of Cuba in a supportive and welcoming environ
 ment!\n\nImportant Details\n\n• Arrival: Please arrive 10 minutes befor
