UID:260813qk0bNF2nREevm5ND9Q4WRA
DESCRIPTION:Immersed in the global electronic music scene\, RON REESER has
  earned support from luminaries like Tiesto\, Don Diablo\, Fedde Le Grand\
 , Kaskade\, and Loud Luxury to name a few. His signature Tech House sound 
 consistently infiltrates DJ sets across the globe.\n\nAn American DJ and p
 roducer\, RON REESER\, originally hailing from the vibrant backdrop of the
  San Francisco Bay Area\, boasts an dynamic discography that spans esteeme
 d labels such as Sony\, Ultra Music\, Sirup\, and Pyro Records. Notably\, 
 his remix catalog features an array of renowned artists\, including Billie
  Eilish\, Dua Lipa\, Coldplay\, Doja Cat\, Chainsmokers\, Coldplay\, Kaska
 de\, Galantis\, Chromeo\, and more. These sonic creations have reverberate
 d on charts\, both in the United States and the United Kingdom\, with a re
 sounding presence on Beatport and iTunes.com.\n\nRecent singles such as "G
 oodies" graced the airwaves and were given the prestigious spotlight on Pe
 te Tong's BBC Radio1 mixshow\, captivating an audience of over 4 million E
 uropean listeners. Simultaneously\, "Lights Off" illuminated Tomorrowland'
 s One World Radio\, casting its spell across the global soundscape. His ea
 rlier creations\, including "Everything" featuring Myah\, "Above All" feat
 uring Sylvia Tosun\, and reimagined versions of Deadmau5's "Raise Your Wea
 pon" and Jes's "Awaken\," ascended to prominence\, consistently dominating
  the airwaves and clinching the number one spot on Sirius Radio's BPM char
 ts\, securing his position as the second most-played artist\, just trailin
 g behind the legendary Kaskade.\n\nFast forward to 2025\, where RON REESER
 's momentum continues to surge. With two electrifying Top 20 Billboard Dan
 ce singles\, a fresh TV mix show syndication on Music Choice reaching over
  2 million viewers monthly through Xfinity Comcast\, a monthly residency o
 n iHeart Radio\, and Wild 94.9's House Music Mixshow "Ghetto House Radio\,
 " syndicated across 47 stations in the United States\, and "Higher\," on P
 yro Records \\(Germany\\) amassing 20 million\\+ combined streams on all a
 ll platforms including Spotify.\n\nStay tuned and visit WWW.RONREESER.COM 
 for more info on releases\, tour dates\, news\, live sets\, podcasts\, and
  more.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108072187?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
