 ul musical endeavor prior to TRJG was the Americana group Cuyama Mama & th
 e Hot Flashes. \n\nHis first record\, Goodbye Home\, was released in COVID
 -2020 - so fun! More music out now - https://therealjohngary.bandcamp.com/
 \n\nCatch TRJG at The Sailing Goat in Pt. Richmond\, Headlands Brewing Laf
 ayette\, Berkeley farmers' markets\, etc.
