 ion to resources\, enrollment for our weekly food pantry\, and our Neighbo
 r Connection Hour at "Saturdays at The Kove"! The Kove is located in a wel
 coming space inside of Northgate Mall. Each Saturday features a different 
 physician or expert-led health and wellness talk with plenty of time to ge
 t your questions answered. Visit www.thekove.org to stay up-to-date!
LOCATION:The Kove community hub
