DESCRIPTION:The Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing Experience invites you on an
  elevated wine journey set in Cuvaison’s stunning waterfront boathouses.
  This luxurious wine tasting experience offers scenic views and a tranquil
  atmosphere\, nestled over the serene reservoir amidst wraparound vineyard
 s. Enjoy a tasting of expertly selected wines paired with seasonal small b
 ites for a curated tasting and pairing.\n\nThe Brandlin Estate Boathouse W
 ine & Food Pairing Experience features 6 wines. The Cuvaison Boathouse Win
 e & Food Pairing Experience features 5 wines.\n\nSet on the edge of the tr
 anquil estate reservoir and surrounded by vineyard views\, the Boathouses 
 offer a peaceful\, private setting for your tasting. Each 120-minute exper
 ience includes a guided flight of estate-grown wines from Cuvaison and Bra
 ndlin Estate\, two estates rooted in Napa Valley history. Together\, they 
 showcase our winemaking philosophy\, from the cool-climate elegance of Los
  Carneros to the bold character of mountain-grown reds from Mt. Veeder.\n\
 nBrandin Estate Menu for July 1st – September 30th\n\nPeaches n Cream\n\
 ncharred peaches | whipped savory lemon cream | toasted nut crumble\n\n202
 4 Brandlin Estate Sauvignon Blanc \n\nMushroom Quiche Tartlet\n\npaprika 
 crema | chives\n\n2022 Brandlin Estate Henry’s Keep\, Red Wine\n\nMorocc
 an Chicken Skewer\n\nred bell pepper sauce | evoo | sunflower see crumble\
 n\n2022 Brandlin Estate Malbec\n\nRoasted Duck Rillette\n\ncooked cherries
 \, red onion & zucchini relish | artisan cracker\n\n2022 Brandlin Estate O
 ld Vine Zinfandel\n\nHerbed Beef Meatballs\n\nsmoked eggplant puree | shav
 ed parmesan\n\n2023 Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvignon\n\n2019 Brandlin Es
 tate Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nBrandlin Estate Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing E
 xperience: $195/person\n\nCuvaison Menu for July 1st – September 30th\n\
 nFeta Mousse | Roasted Corn | Charred Apricot | Radish\n\ntoasted brioche 
 bread\n\n2023 Cuvaison ATS Chardonnay\n\nHerbed Beef Meatloaf\n\ntomato ja
 m | sautéed capers & cocktail onions\n\n2023 Cuvaison Adda Pinot Noir\n\n
 Mushroom Quiche Tartlet\n\npaprika crema | chives\n\n2023 Cuvaison Arcilla
  Merlot\n\nMoroccan Chicken Skewer\n\nred bell pepper sauce | evoo | sunfl
 ower seed crumble\n\n2022 Brandlin Estate Henry’s Keep\, Red Wine\n\n202
 3 Cuvaison Diablo Syrah\n\nCuvaison Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing Experien
 ce: $180/person
