DESCRIPTION:The international Transatlantic Guitar Trio includes fingersty
 le guitar champion Richard Smith \\(UK\\)\; gypsy jazz virtuoso Joscho Ste
 phan \\(Germany\\)\; and the brilliant multi-instrumentalist Rory Hoffman 
 \\(U.S.\\)\, who performed their first live gig together for in 2019 and h
 ave already performed at numerous renowned concert series and at several w
 ell-known festivals in the USA.  It is unique how they put together jazz b
 allads\, gypsy swing standards\, a pinch of pop music and groovy original 
 compositions to create a whole new broad repertoire of newly arranged mate
 rial by the great guitarists Django Reinhardt\, Chet Atkins and Jerry Reed
 . The show by these three stellar guitarists is an incomparable experience
