UID:260830O7T3zNMugku5uqJEtoMRdQ
DESCRIPTION:NSAS Presents: Finding More Birds with Heather Wolf\n\nAbout t
 he Program: Want to see more birds wherever you go? Join author Heather Wo
 lf for an engaging presentation based on her newest book\, Find More Birds
 : 111 Surprising Ways to Spot Birds Wherever You Are. Through photographs\
 , stories\, and practical tips\, Heather will reveal how birds leave clues
  through their behavior\, habitat\, movement\, sounds\, and more—helping
  both beginners and experienced birders find species they may have overloo
 ked. You’ll leave with a fresh perspective on the rich natural world unf
 olding around you every day.\n\nAbout the Presenter: Heather Wolf is the a
 uthor of Find More Birds and Birding at the Bridge. A Brooklyn-based birde
 r\, photographer\, and educator\, she works with the Cornell Lab of Ornith
 ology\, teaches birding classes at Brooklyn Botanic Garden\, and shares he
 r passion for birds through walks\, talks\, writing\, and photography.\n\n
 In-Person: Napa Valley Lutheran Church\, 1796 Elm St\, Napa\, CA 94559\n\n
 Zoom: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/84316492732?pwd=nM7d3DyF632clhMjdLaft0Nvm5
 nvJ4.1\n\nMeeting ID: 843 1649 2732\; Passcode: 748678
LOCATION:Napa Valley Lutheran Church
URL:https://napasolanobirds.org/
