  and whatever sparks in the minds of the performers\, scenes\, characters\
 , and stories come to life right before your eyes. There are no scripts. N
 o sets. No props. No way of knowing what happens next. For one night\, we
 ’re bringing together a collection of talented improvisers from across S
 onoma County\, representing years of experience with past and present impr
 ov groups. Different performers\, different styles\, and absolutely no pla
 n for what’s about to happen. It’s spontaneous. It’s unpredictable. 
 It might get a little insane. And it’s all being made up on the spot. In
  our eyes\, they’re All-Stars. Welcome to the All-Star Improv Showcase!
