UID:260904tKk0wh86VUqcW0OISFzWfQ
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin The Social Contractors as they return to rock Aqu
 s Cafe with an evening of upbeat original rock and their own spin on class
 ic hits you know and love (e.g. Beatles\, CCR\, Hendrix\, Doors\, Pink Flo
 yd\, Police\, Men At Work\, U2\, Tears for Fears\, and more).\n\nThe Socia
 l Contractors lineup for this free live performance features band founder 
 and songwriter\, Jason E Davies (lead vocals\, lead/rhythm guitar)\, Travi
 s Thayer (sax/keys/vocals)\, Rob Neidel (bass)\, and Chris Oatman (drums).
 \n\nWhether you like melodic vocals\, searing guitar and sax solos\, intri
 guing lyrics\, captivating songs\, or just great dynamic and danceable rhy
 thms\, The Social Contractors won't disappoint.\n\nAqus Cafe stands out be
 cause it's much more than a typical cafe. It's known as a community hub\, 
 hosting various events like poetry readings\, music\, community dinners\, 
 knitting circles\, conversation cafes\, and art exhibitions.
LOCATION:Aqus Cafe
URL:https://www.aquscommunity.org/event/__trashed-5/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
