UID:260830iTqv1fjjjEy_fvzOhm5Xxg
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with the return of Sunset Bottle Session
 s\, happening one Friday a month — June 12\, July 10\, August 7\, and BY
  POPULAR DEMAND WE HAVE ADDED 9/11 — from 4–7 PM on the Copain terrace
 .\n\nSettle in for golden hour overlooking the Russian River Valley with C
 opain wines by the glass or bottle\, rotating local food vendors serving b
 ites for purchase\, and a DJ spinning laid-back vinyl and sunset-ready tra
 cks to set the mood.\n\nReservations are $15 and include your first glass 
 of wine. Come early\, stay for the sunset\, and enjoy an easy evening of g
 reat wine\, good music\, and sweeping vineyard views.\n\nKids and friendly
  pets are welcome.Complimentary for Wine Club members.\n\nPlease use email
  for membership when reserving.
