DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable Sonoma County evening at Ru's Far
 m\, a picturesque vineyard setting nestled among rolling vines and breatht
 aking countryside views.\n\nRaise a glass with friends old and new as we g
 ather to celebrate the champions who are helping create safer\, healthier\
 , and more connected communities through bicycling. Enjoy local wine and 
 beverages\, delicious appetizers\, a farm-fresh dinner\, and an exciting a
 uction\, all set against the backdrop of one of Sonoma County's most beaut
 iful venues.\n\nTogether\, we'll honor the individuals\, advocates\, volun
 teers\, and community leaders whose dedication is making Sonoma County a b
 etter place to ride\, walk\, and thrive.\n\nCome celebrate\, connect\, and
  support the movement toward safer streets and a more bicycle-friendly fut
 ure.
LOCATION:Ru's Farm
