BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opening Reception: Illumination in Glass
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T200000
UID:260902qwp9fuhJnUGi9DjsPKSwWg
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning mosaic artist\, actress\, and beauty queen **Mar
 ia Isabel Lopez** invites the public to experience *Illumination in Glass*
 \, a solo exhibition at **Usher Gallery** celebrating the transformative p
 ower of light\, color\, and the human spirit through contemporary mosaic a
 rt.\n\nKnown internationally for her accomplishments in film\, the arts\, 
 and public service\, Lopez brings the same passion and creativity that dis
 tinguished her career as an actress and beauty queen to her work as a visu
 al artist.\n\nJoin us at the opening reception on September 12th from 5pm 
 to 8pm for an opportunity to meet Maria Isabel Lopez\, groove to live tune
 s by Zenia Avila\, and enjoy local refreshments. \n\nThrough luminous mos
 aics crafted from stained glass\, natural stone\, and mixed media\, she tr
 ansforms thousands of individual fragments into powerful works that explor
 e faith\, resilience\, cultural heritage\, nature\, and hope.
LOCATION:Usher Gallery
URL:https://ushergallerypetaluma.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Art of Floral Arranging with California Sister
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T123000
UID:260902VBeJ8UhwJU60VUsfiwzjaw
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Gather Sebastopol for a hands-on floral design work
 shop with Nichole Skalski\, artist\, floral designer\, and owner of Sonoma
  County studio California Sister. Working with seasonal blooms\, you’ll 
 explore the foundations of floral arranging while learning how color\, tex
 ture\, form\, and proportion come together to create a balanced\, expressi
 ve arrangement.\n\nIn this workshop\, you’ll:\n\n• Learn practical tec
 hniques for working with color\, shape\, and texture\n\n• Explore balanc
 e\, proportion\, and composition in floral design\n\n• Build confidence 
 developing arrangements in your own personal style\n\n• Create a seasona
 l floral arrangement to take home\n\nAll flowers\, tools\, and materials a
 re included. No prior floral design experience required.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-floral-arranging-with
 -california-sister
