 ven how to repair things yourself!  \n\nIf you’d like to bring an it
 em to repair\, please register the item here: https://www.reusealliance.or
 g/rf-reg\n\n\\(Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!\\)\n\nT
 his event will also feature a Halloween Costume & Decor Swap! Spooky Seaso
