 and picnic area available \\(bring blankets encouraged\\)\n\nAll ages welc
 ome - family-friendly event\n\nWine available for purchase by the glass or
  bottle\n\nThis is H&L Live at its best: world-class musicians\, golden ho
 ur timing\, and the Russian River Valley as your backdrop. Come early\, st
 ay late\, and experience why the North Bay music scene is legendary.
