UID:260808n68sVn8X0kSz0XCDYgLmEA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun BioBlitz at a brand new State Park property 
 in celebration of California Biodiversity Day 2026! Discover the history o
 f the Sonoma Developmental Center Open Space property and learn how to use
  the iNaturalist app to help us collect biodiversity data. Meet at the int
 ersection of Harney and Railroad in Eldridge\, CA at 10 AM and we will wal
 k together to the peak of Lake Suttonfield where the activity will begin. 
 No RSVP is required for this FREE event! The Suttonfield trail is an easy 
 to moderate unpaved trail with light elevation changes and inconsistent sh
 ade. Water\, sturdy shoes\, and hats are recommended. A smart device with 
 the iNaturalist app already downloaded is recommended prior to arrival. iN
 aturalist page: https://www.inaturalist.org/projects/california-biodivers
 ity-day-2026-sdc-open-space-bioblitz
