BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T170000
UID:260523V5RnxqzvzkmhAB4Tb0ez3A
DESCRIPTION:Discounted early bird tickets are now on sale until July 1\, 2
 026 for the 12th annual Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival Saturday\, Sept
 ember 12 from 1-5 p.m. in historic downtown Petaluma where attendees can e
 njoy craft beer tastings from two dozen regional breweries\, delicious foo
 d from several of Petaluma’s top restaurants and live music from local b
 ands.\n\nGeneral admission includes beer glass\, beer tastings and live mu
 sic. Limited reduced price “designated driver” tickets are also availa
 ble for $25 and include snacks\, nonalcoholic beverages and a $10 gift cer
 tificate for event food purchases. This is a 21-and-over event \\(no child
 ren or babies\\) and animals are not allowed. ID is required at the gate\,
  which will be located at Water Street near the Balshaw Bridge.\n\nHosted 
 by the Petaluma Valley and Petaluma Sunrise Rotary clubs\, the annual comm
 unity fundraising event benefits local non-profit initiatives serving Peta
 luma school children\, isolated seniors\, local homeless people as well as
  Petaluma River enhancement projects.
LOCATION:Petaluma Riverfront
URL:https://petalumarivercraftbeerfest.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
