BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cosmos and Cocoa at Robert Ferguson Obervatory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T230000
UID:26072884opbZ2vxk-073xR_RRP1g
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a cozy evening of astronomy\, storytelling\, and stargaz
 ing during Cosmos and Cocoa. The experience begins with a guided walk alon
 g part of the observatory's Planet Walk trail\, where guests explore scale
  models of the solar system on a scenic 1.2-mile roundtrip hike to Saturn 
 and back. After the walk\, guests return to the observatory to warm up wit
 h hot cocoa while experienced astronomers lead an engaging night sky prese
 ntation blending science and storytelling. The evening continues with tele
 scope viewing\, offering close-up looks at planets\, the Moon\, star clust
 ers\, and distant galaxies. Perfect for families and curious stargazers of
  all ages\, this unique program combines outdoor exploration with the wond
 er of the cosmos.
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/cosmos-and-cocoa-at-robert-ferguson-oberv
 atory/2026-09-12/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
