 , 2026\n\n**Time:** 5:00 p.m. – 9:00 p.m.\n\n**Location:** Jacuzzi Fam
 ily Vineyards 24724 Arnold Drive Sonoma\, CA 95476\n\n**Tickets:** $200 p
 er person\n\n**Purchase Tickets:** cancersupportsonoma.org/wigout\n\nWigO
 ut Sonoma! is Cancer Support Sonoma's signature annual fundraiser. Guests 
 are invited to wear a favorite wig (optional!) and enjoy an unforgettable 
