BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harvest Celebration at Pedroncelli Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T140000
UID:260831RixbO_jcjk2w3GsZN5J2iA
DESCRIPTION:Pedroncelli Winery for their  Harvest Celebration with an excl
 usive behind-the-scenes tour led by members of the Pedroncelli family and 
 winery team. Guests will go beyond the tasting room to experience the sigh
 ts\, sounds\, and aromas of harvest in action. The 30-40-minute tour offer
 s an insider's look at the winemaking process\, from freshly picked grapes
  arriving at the crush pad to temperature-controlled tanks in the cellar. 
 Depending on winery activity\, guests may watch the press in operation and
  even participate in a red wine punch-down with guidance from the winemaki
 ng team. Every tour is unique because harvest never follows a script. Gues
 ts are encouraged to wear comfortable shoes and come ready for an exciting
 \, hands-on experience while gaining a deeper appreciation for the craftsm
 anship behind Pedroncelli wines.
LOCATION:Pedroncelli Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/harvest-celebration-at-pedroncelli-winery
 /
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
