UID:2607145grtz0qMx0m-ScO9vFR-PA
DESCRIPTION:Come join the fun at the Village with the Children’s Museum 
 of Sonoma County!\n\nLessons for Littles Series with Children’s Museum o
 f Sonoma County – Saturday\, September 19th.\n\nCome join us for a fun a
 nd educational event at Montgomery Village in the Courtyard hosted by Chil
 dren’s Museum of Sonoma County on Saturday\, September 19th. Enjoy a mor
 ning of hands-on\, engaging programming where kids will explore and learn 
 through play.\n\nThis event will take place at the Montgomery Village Cour
 tyard\, in the outdoor area in front of Cupcake Children’s Boutique and 
 Kaleidoscope Toys. Recommended for ages 4+. Space is limited\, please rese
 rve your spot today.\n\nPlease note\, you are still responsible for superv
