 where legacy meets celebration and the story continues to unfold. We’ll 
 toast to Jack’s extraordinary life\, reflect on the dream he left behind
 \, and dance into what comes next.\n\nIt’s a birthday. It’s a mileston
 e. It’s a bold wish.\n\n**When:** Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 from 5
 :00-9:00\n\n**Where:** Jack London State Historic Park – Eucalyptus Grov
 e and Winery Ruins\n\n**What to expect:** Delicious appetizers and dinner
