 t keep in mind that dogs and pets are prohibited at Drakes Beach. Particip
 ants should bring sunscreen\, lunch and/or snacks\, and their own water bo
 ttles\, work gloves\, and bucket. The PRNSA Bookstore at Drakes Beach sell
 s merchandise and some pre-packaged food and drinks. Please dress in layer
 s and be prepared for cool\, coastal conditions. For more information\, pl
 ease visit: https://www.nps.gov/planyourvisit/event-details.htm?id=70ECEB9
 8-AFE6-2E4C-E3E267E28507358D  Pre-registration is not required and drop-in
