 er 20th from 12 to 3pm\n\nJoin us at Moshin Vineyards for the opening rec
 eption of our newest art show! This time we're featuring a collaborative e
 xhibition showcasing three talented artists\, each with a distinctive medi
 um and perspective.\n\nCome meet and mingle with the artists while enjoyin
