BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WSET In the Vineyard - Level 3 Award in Wines in Napa and Sonoma
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260921T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260921T170000
UID:260803qbWkcq15KkqjpZwji91fTA
DESCRIPTION:WSET in the Vineyard - Level 3 Award in Wines in Napa and Sono
 ma\, CA September 21–25\, 2026 | Hybrid Format | WSET Level 3 Exam on Se
 ptember 25\n\nImmerse yourself in a truly unique wine education experience
  with WSET in the Vineyard a collaboration with Napa Wine Class — a hybr
 id course combining online learning with four unforgettable days of hands-
 on instruction in the heart of Napa and Sonoma wine country.\n\nThis advan
 ced-level program is designed for dedicated wine professionals and enthusi
 asts looking to deepen their knowledge of viticulture\, winemaking\, and g
 lobal wine styles — all while refining their tasting skills using the WS
 ET Systematic Approach to Tasting \\(SAT\\). Set across diverse vineyard s
 ites and guided by industry leaders\, this course brings theory to life wi
 th structured tastings\, vineyard walks\, and in-depth production sessions
 .\n\nCourse Highlights:\n\nPre-course online self study to build foundatio
 nal theory - Students will be given access to the online classroom at regi
 stration\n\nFour full days of immersive\, expert-led instruction in the vi
 neyard\n\nHands-on learning covering viticulture\, winemaking\, sustainabi
 lity\, and wine evaluation\n\nGuided tastings and workshops with respected
  winemakers and educators\n\nWSET Level 3 exam on the final day \\(Septemb
 er 25\\)\n\nDaily lunches and one winemaker dinner included\n\nTransportat
 ion provided to and from vineyard locations each day\n\nEnjoy warm\, perso
 nalized hospitality throughout the program\n\nFrom sparkling and biodynami
 c production to mountain and coastal viticulture\, each day offers dynamic
  opportunities to learn directly from the source.\n\nWe have a stunning li
 ne up for WSET in the Vineyard! See the full itinerary below! \n\nPrice: 
 $3495\n\nPlease note: Hotels\, airfare\, and transportation to and from yo
 ur hotel are not included in the course fee. Trip insurance is always reco
 mmended.\n\nWhether you're advancing your wine career or personal expertis
 e\, this course is your gateway to real-world wine knowledge — in the pl
 ace where it’s made.\n\nEnrollment is limited. Reserve your seat today a
 nd take your wine education to the next level.
LOCATION:Napa/Sonoma
URL:https://hub.cityspark.com/event/submission/NorCalPublicMedia?utm_mediu
 m=internal&utm_source=hub&utm_campaign=submit-ev
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
