DESCRIPTION:Learn sewing: from how to use a machine\, thread a needle\, an
 d simple quilting. We welcome anybody who wants to learn sewing skills\, m
 ake new friends\, and create. Our community partner\, The Santa Rosa Quilt
  Guild will provide all materials -- fabric\, thread\, sewing machines\, n
