UID:260831KIt8FRbHR06tQVtCX6VywQ
DESCRIPTION:**An Inspiring Conversation with Anne Lamott: On Hope\, Humor\
 , and Living Fully**\n\nJoin bestselling author Anne Lamott for an evening
  of laugh-out-loud wit\, wisdom\, and heartfelt conversation. Known for be
 loved books including *Bird by Bird* and *Traveling Mercies*\, Lamott has 
 spent decades helping readers navigate life's joys and challenges with hon
 esty\, humor\, and grace.\n\nIn this moderated discussion\, she will share
  insights on hope\, resilience\, creativity\, and finding meaning in an im
 perfect world.\n\n**Wednesday\, September 23\, 2026 Green Music Center\, S
 onoma State University**\n\n**6:00 - 7:00** \n\n**Book signing to follow!*
 *\n\n**Tickets:** \n\n**$44 ($38 plus parking and LBC fees)**\n\nFor ticke
 ts and information\, visit socowomenevents.com.
LOCATION:Green Music Center
URL:https://www.socowomenevents.com/
