BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mexican Street Food: An Evening with Gerardo Diaz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260923T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260923T193000
UID:260822sCi456IrKkGK1RcqSdiL6w
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 23\, 2026\n\n5:30 PM – 7:30 PM\n\nLoca
 tion\n\nRoom 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\n\nExperien
 ce Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$1
 00\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$100\n\nRo
 ll up your sleeves for a hands-on cooking class with Gerardo Díaz\, celeb
 rating the bold\, vibrant world of Mexican street food. You’ll learn to 
 bring classic antojitos to life\, mastering the traditional techniques and
  fresh ingredients behind each dish as you cook alongside Gerardo. Then si
 t down to enjoy the fruits of your work\, packed with the layered flavors 
 that make Mexican street food so beloved. Whether you’re new to the kitc
 hen or a confident cook\, you’ll leave with new skills and plenty to sho
 w for it. Come hungry and ready to cook.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/mexican-street-food-an-even
 ing-with-gerardo-diaz/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
