UID:260815agOLJUpyUUqnigz6FJSVgQ
DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays Weekly · 8 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nAugust 5 – Se
 ptember 23\, 2026\n\n6:00 PM – 9:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramic
 s Studio\n\nCategory\n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\
 nAdvanced\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:
 \n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nThis session is designed fo
 r people who have already taken multiple wheel throwing courses. A continu
 ation of our intermediate course\, this upper level / advanced course will
  help you hone your throwing skills through more complex demos\, and nuanc
 ed approaches to technical throwing. In this 8 week course\, students will
  dive deep into developing their own unique voice as they build a technica
 l toolset for the independent maker. In addition to throwing\, surface dec
 oration techniques will be explored as well as the opportunity to experime
 nt with different clay bodies.With your 8 week class registration\, studen
 ts receive the opportunity to purchase a studio pass for ½ off during the
  duration of their class. Sign ups for membership will be included.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/pottery-on-the-wheel-advanc
 ed-august/
