DESCRIPTION:Register for a 3-hour appointment to digitize your documents a
 nd photos\, slides and negatives. Appointments are available Thursdays\, F
 ridays\, and Saturdays\, 1-4pm. Limited to 1 station per day\, 1 appointme
 nt per week\, per library card holder. The Memory Lab user who books the l
 ab appointment must have a Sonoma County Library general card account\, be
  age 18 or older\, and read and agree to the User Agreement online. By cli
 cking "Register" on this event\, the Lab User agrees to follow the terms a
 nd conditions in the attached User Agreement. For more information: If you
  need Spanish-language assistance for your first visit\, please contact st
