 uzuki Cady and Jimmy Murphy)** \\- An uplifting\, signature mix of traditi
 onal Irish tunes and Roots-Americana vocal blends on fiddle\, mandolin\, g
 uitar\, banjo\, and bodhrán in a beautiful space with great acoustics\, c
