  the workshop\, guests will:\n\nLearn foundational mosaic techniques Desig
 n and assemble a custom piece\, such as a mirror or photo frame Work with 
 a curated selection of materials including tile\, glass\, and mirror\n\nAl
 l materials are included\, along with your base piece\, adhesive\, grout\,
  and a thoughtfully selected assortment of mosaic elements. Guests are als
 o welcome to bring small personal items to incorporate into their design.\
 n\nNo experience is necessary—this workshop is designed for all s
