DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T170000
UID:26090488blIMdy10yNp6MiK5ahig
DESCRIPTION:Suzanne Jacquot Art is currently showing 18 works of art on pa
 per and canvas. Suzanne's art is inspired by her daily walks in nature thr
 oughout Sonoma County's trails and parks. She has found each day a new adv
 enture and delights in both the outward chaos and inward inherent structur
 e of nature. The times of day and the seasons bring with it different and 
 exciting color palettes. Location: La Crema Winery\, 3575 Slusser Rd\, Win
 dsor\, CA 95492 Time: Tuesday thru Sunday 10am - 5pm. Dates: Opens July 20
 26 and continues til July 207.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/suzanne-jacquot-art-at-la-crema-winer
 y/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Modern Love: The David Bowie Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T220000
UID:260819U9N_PIuptEqjU1CHXLhv4w
DESCRIPTION:MODERN LOVE - The David Bowie Experience is a high-energy\, au
 thentic DAVID BOWIE tribute to one of the most innovative and influential 
 artists of all time. With meticulous attention to detail\, MODERN LOVE rec
 reates the music\, the style\, and the charisma that made David Bowie a gl
 obal icon. MODERN LOVE takes audiences on a journey through the eclectic c
 atalog of Bowie's legendary career\, bringing a balance between theatrical
  flair and genuine musicianship\, pulling the crowd into Bowie's ever-evol
 ving universe. Front man Damon Taylor Frick delivers a performance that's 
 remarkably true to Bowie - he doesn't just sing Bowie's songs- he understa
 nds them. His vocals carry that familiar Bowie tone and phrasing and he co
 mfortably inhabits the material\, vocally\, visually\, and in spirit - Mod
 ern Love is an experience that will leave you in awe. OPENING ACT: HAMES\,
 a high-energy rock/pop act led by singer/guitarist Nick Hames\, the show b
 lends blues-driven classic rock with modern indie pop and alternative\, de
 livering a crowd-friendly mix ofstrong originals and recognizable favorite
 s.HAMES connects with a wide audience and brings a professional\, promotio
 nal partnership to every performance. Classic rock\, blues\, alternative a
 nd some 90s. Think - Hendrix\, Stevie Ray Vaughan\, Zeppelin\, Aerosmith\,
  Toto\, The Police\, BB King\, Goo Goo Dolls\, etc. HAMES' sound unites pe
 ople of all ages to come together and enjoy his unique and addictive sound
  and performances Doors open 6:30 pm. BUY IN ADVANCE! TICKETS AT THE DOOR 
 ZONE C ONLY.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/modern-love-the-david-bowie-experienc
 e/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
