DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T160000
UID:260905Zq-iEYoIUE6he4dIo7YzRA
DESCRIPTION:Volunteers at the newly reorganized Hessel Grange are working 
 to raise money to restore their historic hall and grounds. Come support us
  by picking up a pie at our drive-through pie sale\, during the weekend of
  Sept. 26-27 at 5400 Blank Road\, Sebastopol. Pies are $25 donation each a
 nd will feature home baked goodness with fresh ingredients\, most locally 
